# Plan - Fix Invalid Constant Value Error

The [app_theme.dart](file:///c:/projects/Antigravity/shmarthouse/shmarthouse_app/lib/core/theme/app_theme.dart) file uses `const` constructors for `TextTheme`, `AppBarTheme`, and `NavigationRailThemeData`. However, these constructors are passed values from [AppTextStyles](file:///c:/projects/Antigravity/shmarthouse/shmarthouse_app/lib/core/theme/app_text_styles.dart#7-58) (like `AppTextStyles.display`), which are implemented using `GoogleFonts` getters. Since `GoogleFonts` methods are runtime function calls, they cannot be evaluated as compile-time constants, leading to the "Invalid constant value" error.

## Proposed Changes

### Theme Component

#### [MODIFY] [app_theme.dart](file:///c:/projects/Antigravity/shmarthouse/shmarthouse_app/lib/core/theme/app_theme.dart)
- Remove `const` from `TextTheme` initialization.
- Remove `const` from `AppBarTheme` initialization.
- Remove `const` from `NavigationRailThemeData` initialization.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `flutter analyze` to ensure there are no more static analysis errors.

### Manual Verification
- Verify that the app builds successfully.
